{"task":"transcribe","language":"english","duration":26.829999923706055,"text":"A grave relief from the 5th century BC, showing two women, a daughter embracing her mother. Their names are cut above them. What is remarkable is how plainly the goodbye is said. No gods, no symbols, no words. Only two bodies touching. The ancient gravestones of Rhodes are full of scenes like this, and they have left us hundreds of names of people we would otherwise never know had existed.","words":[{"word":"A","start":0,"end":0.47999998927116394},{"word":"grave","start":0.47999998927116394,"end":0.800000011920929},{"word":"relief","start":0.800000011920929,"end":1.2000000476837158},{"word":"from","start":1.2000000476837158,"end":1.440000057220459},{"word":"the","start":1.440000057220459,"end":1.7799999713897705},{"word":"5th","start":1.7799999713897705,"end":2.0399999618530273},{"word":"century","start":2.0399999618530273,"end":2.2799999713897705},{"word":"BC","start":2.2799999713897705,"end":2.8399999141693115},{"word":"showing","start":3.4800000190734863,"end":3.5399999618530273},{"word":"two","start":3.5399999618530273,"end":3.859999895095825},{"word":"women","start":3.859999895095825,"end":4.059999942779541},{"word":"a","start":4.559999942779541,"end":5.039999961853027},{"word":"daughter","start":5.039999961853027,"end":5.039999961853027},{"word":"embracing","start":5.039999961853027,"end":5.539999961853027},{"word":"her","start":5.539999961853027,"end":6.019999980926514},{"word":"mother","start":6.019999980926514,"end":6.019999980926514},{"word":"Their","start":6.78000020980835,"end":6.940000057220459},{"word":"names","start":6.940000057220459,"end":7.119999885559082},{"word":"are","start":7.119999885559082,"end":7.599999904632568},{"word":"cut","start":7.599999904632568,"end":7.659999847412109},{"word":"above","start":7.659999847412109,"end":8},{"word":"them","start":8,"end":8.260000228881836},{"word":"What","start":8.979999542236328,"end":9.100000381469727},{"word":"is","start":9